ez-local-gif matte sidecar — third-party notices
=================================================

The sidecar itself (matte.py, png.py, tools/, tests/) is part of ez-local-gif
and carries the repository's licence. The images built from sidecar/Dockerfile
contain the following third-party software; the full licence texts are in
LICENSES/ (copied verbatim from the wheels' own licence files or the upstream
repositories, never retyped). Versions are those of requirements-cpu.txt /
requirements-cuda.txt / requirements-sam2.txt (Phase 5c, 2026-10-09).

