  Removed after the install, so NOT in the image: triton 3.8.0 (MIT) and
  nvidia-cusolver 12.0.4.66 — torch pulls them in but nothing links them at
  load time and inference never calls them (Dockerfile ARG PRUNE). NCCL,
  cuSPARSELt, cuFile and NVSHMEM stay because libtorch links them at load
  time (readelf -d, torch 2.14.1+cu130).
  These libraries are redistributed under the terms of those agreements; the
  image contains no NVIDIA driver — the host's driver (>= 580) is used through
  nvidia-container-toolkit.

